        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-05T17:10:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>But will they actually fit in the EE box? Or will you have to make room for the new stuff? On my villain/environment half of the box, I'm completely out of room, since the tokens and foam are also taking up space. I can see making room for two new heroes on the other half, but four (five!) new villains and two (maybe three!) new evironments couldn't possibly fit in there.</p>",
