        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lugaru/{size}/2767_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-05T18:10:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think everything will fit, but the foam would come out meaning the tokens would probably be stored separately.</p><p>On the villains/enviroment side I have the foam laying across which means room for a FEW decks, on the heroes side it is stuffed in there normally so that should accomodate 2 heroes and a promo hero.</p><p>I dont do sleves though, although I'm tempted to clear sleve the character cards just to diferentiate them from the rest of the deck.</p>",
